    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This games main focus is its silent narrative, meaning the story is told without text or dialogue. An active plot unfolds through scenes using characters expressions, music, and visual language. Exploration, Combat, and Boss fights are between the brief narrative scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the games tutorials and menus use no text either. So, with the exception of the game's title/logo there are no languages present in the game and can be enjoyed without understanding English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Summary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A woman longs for her lost husband when the storm rolls in. Then strange figures attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/973f0c1c48a61a4d7959f43bc18c8f36.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/48d4fe726e68a923d213173ce2432ebb.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/4289d013f155699cac2a115fef804f72.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More of these soldiers come in forcing her to flee into the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/ac632b76ba72fa4e098e43f019bd4272.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/ac2dd44d8140d0cbc9fb43ba41eabd68.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/73cda3a72ddd495184cd9c164df819f2.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There she meets a strange person that she seems to recognize, though he does not recognize her. The two of them continue to run from the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/d9653a49453335d5016ec81f89c0a282.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/9607bed2e5849c505717954543cfc741.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/4bf9c8874dcd0191df33aba9810fd3cf.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming up the neighboring city seeking refuge an unexpected someone is waiting there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/1e2edd136af717a8a89cdeaa62bf1a95.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time a block correctly to parry an enemy's attack and reduce their stamina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/24a402c79e38f1811f20d5527fb27767.poster.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/24a402c79e38f1811f20d5527fb27767.webm?t=1752847351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/24a402c79e38f1811f20d5527fb27767.mp4?t=1752847351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an enemy's stamina run out, they will be briefly stunned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/74956ed0144361e2ca3c63202f9f7a30.poster.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/74956ed0144361e2ca3c63202f9f7a30.webm?t=1752847351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/74956ed0144361e2ca3c63202f9f7a30.mp4?t=1752847351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid unblockable attacks by dodging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/60d7871e728f576c9311aba5596ed76a.poster.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/60d7871e728f576c9311aba5596ed76a.webm?t=1752847351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/60d7871e728f576c9311aba5596ed76a.mp4?t=1752847351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemy's and exploring will accumulate EXP and level up the player character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expected playtime for this game should be around 3 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This games main focus is its silent narrative, meaning the story is told without text or dialogue. An active plot unfolds through scenes using characters expressions, music, and visual language. Exploration, Combat, and Boss fights are between the brief narrative scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the games tutorials and menus use no text either. So, with the exception of the game's title/logo there are no languages present in the game and can be enjoyed without understanding English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Summary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A woman longs for her lost husband when the storm rolls in. Then strange figures attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/973f0c1c48a61a4d7959f43bc18c8f36.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/48d4fe726e68a923d213173ce2432ebb.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/4289d013f155699cac2a115fef804f72.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More of these soldiers come in forcing her to flee into the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284910/extras/ac632b76ba72fa4e098e43f019bd4272.avif?t=1752847351\" width=600 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=